// Every later visit, while the bird is still free: the scripted encounter
// with thunderwing (east's legendary). Win, lose or run, the engine decides
// the catch and raises caught@mon.thunderwing (east.thunderwingCaught).

## The chimney

::bg{location="power-plant-roof" time="night"}
::music{action="change" mood="battle" volume="up"}
::vfx{type="flash"}
@narrator: At the top of the chimney stair the sky is very close. On the lip of the chimney, wings folded, sits a bird made of yellow light.
@narrator: It looks at you the way the lighthouse looks at the sea. Then it opens its wings, and every bulb in the plant goes out at once.
::encounter{species="thunderwing" level="50"}
